      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nLocated in an established estate on the west side of the city with proximity to woodland walks, playing fields and community centre. This semidetached property comes available with off street parking, where the internal of the property has been redecorated. Modernised over the years, this home offers a living room with laminate flooring, open fire place and bay window. A fully fitted kitchen with breakfast counter is situated to the back of the property with adjoining dining room. Access to the bespoke back yard with beautiful paving feature through sliding patio door. A WC completes the ground floor. Upstairs are two double bedrooms both with fitted wardrobes, where the main bedroom comes with modern en-suite shower room. Adjacent to this is the single bedroom with oodles of storage. A fully tiled shower room with electric shower completes this floor. A bright welcoming property walking distance to shops, bus stop and more."
      },
